# Copy to courier.env (gitignored) and fill in. The wrapper auto-loads it
# (shared couriers/courier.env first, then this package's courier.env).
#
# Where the standalone Core Core Music Editor Agent engine checkout lives.
# The wrapper execs entries in its factory/ and reads its state files for
# status. Only set this if the engine lives somewhere non-default.
# NOTE: the default path contains spaces — keep it quoted if you set it.
#OCEAN_CORE_MUSIC_EDITOR_ENGINE_DIR="/Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/Core Core Music Editor Agent"

# Python used for the Pinterest/Twitter scrapers (the Lab venv carries their
# browser-capture deps, per the engine docs). Falls back to python3 if unset
# or missing.
#OCEAN_CORE_MUSIC_EDITOR_PYTHON="$HOME/Projects/active/content-posting-lab/venv/bin/python"

# No tokens belong in this package. The engine self-loads its repo-root .env
# (SLACK_BOT_TOKEN, SLACK_CHANNEL, DRIVE_FOLDER_ID, XAI_API_KEY, …); Gemini
# auth resolves GEMINI_API_KEY → GOOGLE_API_KEY → Vertex ADC inside the
# engine's own scripts.
